		{
			dependencies: ["56D3A3CFEF28BF91"]
			description: [
				"&7ネザーには戦えるボスがたくさんいます。中には弱いボスもいれば、より脅威的なボスもいます。"
				""
				"&4Finding a Nether City.&r These Cities yield blocks of Netherite and a ton of other good gear that can help you on your journey. &eThe City is mostly made out of Quartz and Cinnasite.&r"
				""
				"&4Finding a Black Spiral in the Nether&r. These have tons of Piglins and tons of valueables. Make sure to dig down into the Towers. The Structure is mostly made of Blackstone and looks like many Towers connected to one another."
				""
				"&4Tech.&r If you already wasted your time mining or got Ancient Debris in another way, there is many ways to make more of what you have. You can reach up to a 8 times yield with the right setup."
				"Of course, you can always use &9UU Matter&r from Tech Reborn to make an nigh infinite supply of Netherite."
			]
			id: "1702057B5F68995F"
